{"study_accession":"PRJEB25446","secondary_study_accession":"ERP107363","title":"Cancer stem cell exosome message transfer into pancreatic non-cancer stem cells: The importance of CD44v6","description":"Cancer stem cell exosomes (CIC-TEX) promote EMT in Non-CIC. Deep sequencing revealed that transferred CIC-TEX, not directly accounting for the altered Non-CIC mRNA and miRNA profile, trigger activation of Non-CIC inherent programs including signal transduction, transcription, translation and miRNA processing. The CIC marker CD44v6 plays a central role by its association with RTK and the mRNA processing machinery. In vivo controls suggest a blockade of CIC markers offering a most promising option in adjuvant therapy.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":5,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMEA104671377","study_accession":"PRJEB25446","blood_class":"plasma_serum_cfrna","class_from":"study","title":"Holo_TEX","description":"Holo_TEX","sex":"","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2018-05-07","attributes":[["ENA-CHECKLIST","ERC000011"],["ENA-FIRST-PUBLIC","2018-05-07T17:02:04Z"],["organism","Homo sapiens"],["ENA-LAST-UPDATE","2018-03-08T09:29:28Z"],["scientific_name","Homo sapiens"],["common name","human"],["ENA-FIRST-PUBLIC","2018-05-07"],["ENA-LAST-UPDATE","2018-03-08"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"ERR2380258","experiment_accession":"ERX2428568","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2000","read_count":30738117,"base_count":1536905850,"first_public":"2018-05-07","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2000 sequencing"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMEA104671378","study_accession":"PRJEB25446","blood_class":"plasma_serum_cfrna","class_from":"study","title":"Tsp8-kd_control","description":"Tsp8-kd_control","sex":"","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2018-05-07","attributes":[["ENA-CHECKLIST","ERC000011"],["ENA-FIRST-PUBLIC","2018-05-07T17:02:04Z"],["orga